nrc-10cfr-part52-col pack: content licence
=======================================================

This pack is derived from two sources:

1. 10 CFR Part 52, Licenses, Certifications, and Approvals for Nuclear
   Power Plants (selected slices)
   Publisher: U.S. Government; text via the Electronic Code of Federal
   Regulations (eCFR), title 10 current as of 2026-11-09; pin-check
   2026-11-11

2. NRC Regulatory Guide 1.206, Applications for Nuclear Power Plants,
   Rev 1, October 2018, accession ML18131A181; issuance notice Federal
   Register 2018-22262 (83 FR 51712)
   Publisher: U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission

Source licence: Public Domain (US Government work, 17 U.S.C. 105) (tier 1;
see ../../docs/SOURCE-VETTING.md). No source-material download link is
published.

Both source works are United States Government works and are not subject
to copyright protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. 105). They are in
the public domain. Regulatory guides are not copyrighted and NRC approval
is not required to reproduce them. Anyone may reproduce, transform, and
redistribute for any purpose, including commercially, without permission
and without any attribution or share-alike obligation.

Attribution to NRC is a courtesy (see the repository NOTICE), not a legal
obligation. NRC does not endorse this pack or its authors.

Reconstruction: pack content is synthesized orientation notes from the
eCFR public-domain text and RG 1.206 pin facts. The RG PDF body was not
captured; RG claims rest on the issuance-notice pin only. Verbatim
excerpts capped at two sentences. The pack carries no staff positions
stated as requirements.

NOTE: this file governs the CONTENT of the pack. Repository tooling stays
